OL,3,GNEWSAPop-up installations to highlight
OL,4,Ahomelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FStories about homelessness will be the
OL,7,Ffocus of a pop-up campaign.
OL,9,FAt Home In Guernsey said it had created
OL,10,Fsix installations across the island
OL,11,Fincluding a sofa in Market Square,
OL,12,Fsleeping bags in the doorways of Lloyds
OL,13,Fbranches and tents outside Waitrose
OL,14,Fsupermarkets as part of World Homeless
OL,15,FDay on Saturday.
OL,17,FIt said the temporary installations
OL,18,Fwould be in place over the weekend to
OL,19,Fhighlight stories of homelessness in
OL,20,FGuernsey and show what support is
OL,21,Favailable.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
