OL,3,GNEWSAPop-up installations to highlight
OL,4,Ahomelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlie Cox, chief executive officer of
OL,7,FAt Home In Guernsey, said World
OL,8,FHomeless Day was an important moment to
OL,9,F"pause, reflect and talk honestly"
OL,10,Fabout the topic.
